{
  "name": "spo-property-portal",
  "description": "A property management portal for Saint Paul's Outreach, Inc. (SPO), where staff manage properties, maintenance requests, walkthrough inspections, physical assets, vendor contacts and invoices, and residents submit and track their own maintenance requests. It is a single Express server on Node 20 that serves both the REST API and the React SPA on one port, backed by PostgreSQL through Drizzle ORM. Note: this project has over 100 source files; consider scoping analysis to a subdirectory for faster results.",
